{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>And he shall bring near the living goat.</b> Up to here it requires it to be alive. <b>החי</b> — the het has a tsere and the yod has a patach and hatuf, a mnemonic: ההרים (its letters)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {0 "The mnemonic ההרים presumably encodes the vowel signs; the phrase פת״ח has been read as פתח (patach) and חטף (hatuf), but the exact masoretic technical terminology here is uncertain."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:12:51.627670513Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}